              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 1:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akagendagenda omu Galiraaya yoona, naayegesa omu masorrokaniro gaabo, naarangirra Amakuru Amarungi ag'obukama bwa Ruhanga, kandi naakiza buli ndwara n'obusaasi bwona obw'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaranganwa omu Siriya yoona, baamuleetera abarwaire boona abakaba bakwasirwe endwara n'obusaasi obutali bumu, abakwasirwe emyoyo emibi, abagu b'ensimbo, n'abazingamire; yabakiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebitebe by'abantu baingi bakamuhondera nibaruga Galiraaya, n'omu Mbuga Ikumi ezeeteraine, Yerusaalemu, Buyudaaya, na nseeri ya Yorudaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
